      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d9b0c8b7ef1daa58\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHe was succeeded by his elder daughter, Elizabeth II. Albert was born at 3:05 am on 14 December 1895 at York Cottage, on the Sandringham Estate in Norfolk, during the reign of his great-grandmother Queen Victoria. His father was Prince George, Duke of York (later King George V), the second and only surviving son of the Prince and Princess of Wales (later King Edward VII and Queen Alexandra).\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d9b0c8b7ef1daa58\">>>",
